			"notes": "# A silly little mod that adds a bunch of food you can craft with ores.\n\n## Raw/Cooked Copperchop\n* +4 Nutrition\n* +4 Saturation\n\n95 Durability Raw, 191 Durability Cooked\n\n\n### Crafting\n\n<img width=\"630\" height=\"320\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/060d53fb-cb1e-4654-a201-a30f9177e903\" />\n\n\n### Smelting\n\n<img width=\"458\" height=\"322\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4408f06e-6ed1-467f-a6ac-1927601ea19e\" />\n\n\n### Blasting\n\n<img width=\"458\" height=\"320\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73ab5175-d960-4fbb-b93c-52bc5abaa7ec\" />\n\n\n## Raw/Cooked Ironchop\n* +6 Nutrition\n* +6 Saturation\n\n125 Durability Raw, 250 Durability Cooked\n\n\n### Crafting\n\n<img width=\"630\" height=\"323\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d67fe456-0654-4149-8cfb-c592ffb8fb63\" />\n\n\n### Smelting\n\n<img width=\"457\" height=\"319\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/966b755a-e9c9-4d4a-8061-7b7e5446dd4a\" />\n\n\n### Blasting\n\n<img width=\"456\" height=\"324\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b80bb2e-439f-4471-886e-753fc340c378\" />\n\n\n## Raw/Cooked Goldchop\n* +10 Nutrition\n* +10 Saturation\n* x2 Eating Speed\n\n125 Durability Raw, 250 Durability Cooked\n\n\n### Crafting\n\n<img width=\"625\" height=\"318\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c25b282d-cf04-414e-8cb8-ba8820ceb098\" />\n\n\n### Smelting\n\n<img width=\"455\" height=\"319\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ba5d3a4-5ef2-48dd-8b63-0fa11fcacab8\" />\n\n\n### Blasting\n\n<img width=\"458\" height=\"318\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad2047e9-2ffc-4486-93d2-24f5ff048b9d\" />\n###\n## Diamondchop/Netheritechop\n* +8 Nutrition\n* +8 Saturation\n\n1561 Durability Diamond, 2031 Durability Netherite\n\n\n### Crafting\n\n<img width=\"627\" height=\"321\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/194e80df-61ac-43a9-82a5-016a1f22a313\" />\n\n\n### Smithing\n\n<img width=\"591\" height=\"190\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/19e2a96b-584c-4460-9629-b088c5a63ced\" />\n\n\n## Unending Enchantment\n* Effect: Chance to nullify durability damage on consumption.\n* Level I: 25%\n* Level II: 50%\n* Level III: 75%\n\n\n### Crafting: Level I Book\n\n<img width=\"630\" height=\"328\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e968ad7b-1116-41d5-99ee-f6f5f193a004\" />\n\n## Filling Enchantment\n* Effect: Chance to double nutrition on consumption.\n* Level I: 25%\n* Level II: 50%\n* Level III: 75%\n\n\n### Crafting: Level I Book\n\n<img width=\"626\" height=\"318\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2b5315b-57f8-4ad8-8108-a60ca437149c\" />\n\n\nTo get Level II+ you must combine in an anvil. Neither enchantments can be applied at an Enchantment Table."
